# Build outputs — regenerable via build.sh; publish downloads via GitHub Releases.
dist/
*.zip
*.xpi

# Screenshot harness: the source is tracked, everything a run generates is not.
# `ext/` is a copy of the extension rebuilt on every run, `profile/` is a browser profile,
# and `out/` and `events.json` are reproduced by `node all.mjs`.
screenshot-kit/ext/
screenshot-kit/profile/
screenshot-kit/out/
screenshot-kit/events.json

# Signing keys never belong in here. This is a guard, not a wall — the key itself should live
# outside the repository, because a rule in a file cannot stop `git add -f`, a backup script, or
# the next tool that walks this directory.
*.pem
*.crx
# The public half too. It is not a secret — Chrome derives it from any packed .crx — but
# nothing here reads it, and a .pub sitting in the root of a security-sensitive project
# invites the wrong question from anyone skimming.
*.pub
